      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Bullewijk is an Amsterdam Metro station in the Bijlmermeer area of Amsterdam, Netherlands. The station opened in 1977 and is served by 2 lines, the 50 (Isolatorweg - Gein) and 54 (Amsterdam Centraal - Gein).",
